sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User Browser
  participant R as React App
  participant H as Hono Server
  participant A as Auth.js Core
  participant P as OAuth Provider
  participant D as DynamoDB

  U->>R: Click "Sign in with Provider"
  R->>H: GET /api/auth/signin?provider
  H->>A: Forward request
  A->>P: Redirect with client ID & scopes
  P-->>U: Consent Screen
  U->>P: Approve access
  P->>H: Callback with authorization code
  H->>A: Exchange code for tokens
  A->>D: Persist session & profile
  A-->>H: Session object
  H-->>R: Redirect to /dashboard
  R-->>U: Authenticated dashboard
